#: ../../source/components_basic/41-component_espc201.rst:17
msgid "ESPC2-01 Module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/components_basic/41-component_espc201.rst:23
msgid "The ESPC2-01 is a Wi-Fi and Bluetooth LE module built around the **ESP32-C2** chip (also sold as ESP8684), made by Espressif Systems. A single module provides both the Wi-Fi connection and the Bluetooth LE link used by the projects in this kit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/components_basic/41-component_espc201.rst:27
msgid "Internally the module runs the Espressif **ESP-AT** firmware, so it is driven with plain AT commands over a serial port."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/components_basic/41-component_espc201.rst:30
msgid "The module **plugs directly into the Wi-Fi adapter supplied with the kit** - no jumper wires are needed. The adapter carries the 3.3 V regulator and the level conversion between the 5 V board and the 3.3 V module."
msgstr ""

